# Boundary files are NOT in this repo. They are derived from the GRID3 / eHA
# operational LGA layer and redistribution is a licensing question this project
# is not the right place to settle. Build them locally:
#     pip install geopandas shapely
#     python static/build_boundaries.py path/to/lga_boundaries.geojson
# Without them the app runs normally and simply draws no maps.
static/nigeria_states.geojson
static/nigeria_lgas.geojson

